  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut red onion into wedges. Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks. Place on a lined oven tray. Season with salt and pepper and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Chop cauliflower into small florets (including the stalk!). Place onto a second lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and sprinkle with garlic seasoning.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender and browned, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627decfebdc6a0e2c004ddea/step-b98fdae8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice lemon into wedges. In a small bowl, combine the yoghurt and a squeeze of lemon juice. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627decfebdc6a0e2c004ddea/step-4e540443.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. Melt butter in a medium saucepan over medium-high heat. Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add the water and vegetable stock and bring to the boil.\n• Stir in couscous and a drizzle of olive oil. Cover and remove from heat. Set aside until water is absorbed, 5 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627decfebdc6a0e2c004ddea/step-0fc66bb9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir roasted carrot, onion, spinach and a squeeze of lemon juice through couscous.\n• Divide couscous between bowls, top with cauliflower, almonds and lemon yoghurt. Serve with any remaining lemon wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/627decfebdc6a0e2c004ddea/step-8ab0dfbc.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
